{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日前有網民在港鐵「野生捕獲」許思敏（群姐），她大方與粉絲合照，笑容燦爛。相中可見，群姐當日化上全妝，配戴亮眼項鍊與耳環，手上更戴著閃閃發光的黃鑽鑽戒，非常奪目。一眾網民看後紛紛激讚群姐氣色極佳，且貴氣難掩。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8e75be03-c044-494d-b940-1d50dd89c0ab.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ABq8xzqyjW1786524005.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8e75be03-c044-494d-b940-1d50dd89c0ab.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現年70歲的群姐憑著無綫處境劇《愛·回家之開心速遞》中飾演搞笑爽朗的清潔工「伊莎貝拉‧群」一角，深受廣大觀眾喜愛。她自80年代起參演多部影視作品，原來她擁有八分之一俄羅斯血統，更曾奪得歌唱比賽冠軍，其年輕時的混血美貌令人印象深刻。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d7072511-a51c-4f5a-bd30-e79411f49339.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026LH0b5XF6qB1786524005.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d7072511-a51c-4f5a-bd30-e79411f49339.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"75452ebb-7280-4cf3-b52e-07fb60968f0f.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026nGJYPiDtEm1786524005.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"75452ebb-7280-4cf3-b52e-07fb60968f0f.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T13:50:00.394296+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}